{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24063","headline":"府西亭纳凉归 · 白居易","name":"府西亭纳凉归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"避暑府西亭，晚归有闲思。\n夏浅蝉未多，绿槐阴满地。\n带宽衫解领，马稳人拢辔。\n面上有凉风，眼前无俗事。\n路经府门过，落日照官次。\n牵联缧绁囚，奔走尘埃吏。\n低眉悄不语，谁复知兹意。\n忆得五年前，晚衙时气味。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}